      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786199365671,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "this it didnt go well , first i used sqlite for make things easier , but it \ndidnt go well with prisma i had many errors i couldnt solve and they are not necesary at all ,\nso i back to postgress so i had to use docker witch is somthing i want to do later to make \nan improvemnt for the system , also i change the database design . so im going to explain everything \nagain : \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "this it didnt go well , first i used sqlite for make things easier , but it \ndidnt go well with prisma i had many errors i couldnt solve and they are not necesary at all ,\nso i back to postgress so i had to use docker witch is somthing i want to do later to make \nan improvemnt for the system , also i change the database design . so im going to explain everything \nagain : \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
