      "updated": 1786200307422,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "also the api's design changed \n\n\nnow we have two dir to store images , the upload ones and \nthe processed ones to make things easier , also \ni give the image an uuid names so things dont mise up in the database \nif there on image with same name .\nnow the schema is like this : ",
